      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it's getting so much more painful and i'm worried it's gonna burst on its own anyway. if i just use a really fine needle and soak it in alcohol first, wouldn't that make it basically the same as what a doctor would do? i just need to get the pressure out so it stops throbbing so bad.",
